lisa-design:
- (coordinator decision) ci.rerun's agent-path contract is ONCE PER TASK PER KEY (the dispatcher's Effect store replays before the provider); per-head reruns in one task use --key rerun-<sha> or no key. Do not fold the head SHA into the server's effectID.
- (coordinator decision) startup_failure is rerun whole (/rerun) like cancelled.
- (coordinator decision) Per-run 403/422 refusals are skipped, not fatal; Outcome "partially-rerun: skipped run <id> (refused|attempt <n>), ..." when something was rerun and something skipped; ErrInvalid only if nothing rerun and something refused. 404 and retryable errors still fail/retry the whole op.
- (coordinator decision) MaxRunAttempts = 3: never take a run past its third attempt; capped runs don't count as rerun.
